  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LAM 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How hath the Lord covered the daughter of Zion with a cloud in his anger,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cast down from heaven unto the earth the beauty of Israel, and remembered not his footstool in the day of his anger!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord hath swallowed up all the habitations of Jacob, and hath not pitied: he hath thrown down in his wrath the strong holds of the daughter of Judah; he hath brought",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "down to the ground: he hath polluted the kingdom and the princes thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath cut off in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fierce anger all the horn of Israel: he hath drawn back his right hand from before the enemy, and he burned against Jacob like a flaming fire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "devoureth round about.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath bent his bow like an enemy: he stood with his right hand as an adversary, and slew all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pleasant to the eye in the tabernacle of the daughter of Zion: he poured out his fury like fire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord was as an enemy: he hath swallowed up Israel, he hath swallowed up all her palaces: he hath destroyed his strong holds, and hath increased in the daughter of Judah mourning and lamentation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he hath violently taken away his tabernacle, as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if it were of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a garden: he hath destroyed his places of the assembly: the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath caused the solemn feasts and sabbaths to be forgotten in Zion, and hath despised in the indignation of his anger the king and the priest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord hath cast off his altar, he hath abhorred his sanctuary, he hath given up into the hand of the enemy the walls of her palaces; they have made a noise in the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", as in the day of a solemn feast.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath purposed to destroy the wall of the daughter of Zion: he hath stretched out a line, he hath not withdrawn his hand from destroying: therefore he made the rampart and the wall to lament; they languished together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Her gates are sunk into the ground; he hath destroyed and broken her bars: her king and her princes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "among the Gentiles: the law",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "more;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "her prophets also find no vision from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The elders of the daughter of Zion sit upon the ground,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keep silence: they have cast up dust upon their heads; they have girded themselves with sackcloth: the virgins of Jerusalem hang down their heads to the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mine eyes do fail with tears, my bowels are troubled, my liver is poured upon the earth, for the destruction of the daughter of my people; because the children and the sucklings swoon in the streets of the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They say to their mothers, Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "corn and wine? when they swooned as the wounded in the streets of the city, when their soul was poured out into their mothers' bosom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What thing shall I take to witness for thee? what thing shall I liken to thee, O daughter of Jerusalem? what shall I equal to thee, that I may comfort thee, O virgin daughter of Zion? for thy breach",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great like the sea: who can heal thee?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy prophets have seen vain and foolish things for thee: and they have not discovered thine iniquity, to turn away thy captivity; but have seen for thee false burdens and causes of banishment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LAM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All that pass by clap",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hands at thee; they hiss and wag their head at the daughter of Jerusalem,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying, Is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this the city that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LAM.2.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "call The perfection of beauty, The joy of the whole earth?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LAM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LAM.2.15"
            ]
          }
